      "version": 3,
      "date": "2026-09-24",
      "change": "Added the shoulder-dystocia sequence-on-a-clock figure, ported from the CRISIS symphysiotomy/dystocia page, following the HELPERR order the card already teaches. Corrected one number while porting: the source figure said cord pH falls 0.04/min, which is Wood's 1973 theoretical estimate; Leung 2011 measured 0.011/min (95% CI 0.004-0.017). Sourced the 5-minute threshold (Leung 2011) and posterior-arm advantage (Poggi 2003)."
    }
